50281.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Girl died after gene-editing treatment in China: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132618106.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/girl-died-after-gene-editing-treatment-in-china-report/articleshow/132618106.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/girl-died-after-gene-editing-treatment-in-china-report/articleshow/132618106.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T08:38:07+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132618114,imgsize-49134.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump confirms Netanyahu's US visit next week amid regional tensions]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132617908.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Netanyahu and Trump agreed to meet in the United States a few weeks ago following a phone conversation. During the call, Netanyahu congratulated Trump on the 250th anniversary of the founding of the United States and praised the close relationship between the two countries. ​​It comes as the US-Israeli war with Iran has again escalated following a breakdown earlier this month of a ceasefire reached as part of a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) signed by the US and Iran.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/trump-confirms-netanyahus-us-visit-next-week-amid-regional-tensions/articleshow/132617908.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/trump-confirms-netanyahus-us-visit-next-week-amid-regional-tensions/articleshow/132617908.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T08:30:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132618038,imgsize-92378.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Burnham brings a 'No. 10' to Manchester to kickstart English 'devolution']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132618069.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/burnham-brings-a-no-10-to-manchester-to-kickstart-english-devolution/articleshow/132618069.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/burnham-brings-a-no-10-to-manchester-to-kickstart-english-devolution/articleshow/132618069.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T08:35:00+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132618098,imgsize-498353.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bangladesh president quits citing deteriorating health]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132618029.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/bangladesh-president-quits-citing-deteriorating-health/articleshow/132618029.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/bangladesh-president-quits-citing-deteriorating-health/articleshow/132618029.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T08:28:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ahsan Tasnim</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132618057,imgsize-11684.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Pakistan, Iran explore fresh talks with US in China-initiated push: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132617938.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Iran Min Close To IRGC Meets Pak Govt Members, Munir]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/pakistan-iran-explore-fresh-talks-with-us-in-china-initiated-push-report/articleshow/132617938.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/pakistan-iran-explore-fresh-talks-with-us-in-china-initiated-push-report/articleshow/132617938.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T08:17:43+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132617953,imgsize-54058.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[10 killed, nearly 100 injured in Russian strike on Ukraine defence event]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132617526.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ukraine's Emergency Services said rescue operations at the site, located north of the capital, had been completed. Images released by the agency showed emergency workers searching through piles of rubble near several residential houses. Addressing the nation, Zelenskyy blamed Russia for the attack but also questioned the decision to organise a defence-related exhibition while the war continues.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/10-killed-nearly-100-injured-in-russian-strike-on-ukraine-defence-event/articleshow/132617526.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/10-killed-nearly-100-injured-in-russian-strike-on-ukraine-defence-event/articleshow/132617526.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T07:33:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132617647,imgsize-272745.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SK Group chairman Chey Tae-won ordered to pay ex-wife Roh Soh-yeong $644M in divorce settlement]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132612943.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A South Korean appeals court on Friday ordered SK Group Chairman Chey Tae-won to pay his former wife, Roh Soh-yeong, 944 billion won (about $644 million) in cash as part of their long-running divorce property settlement, while reaffirming that Chey's SK shares formed part of the couple's marital assets. ]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/sk-group-chairman-chey-tae-won-ordered-to-pay-ex-wife-roh-soh-yeong-644-million-in-divorce-settlement-court-upholds-claim-over-marital-assets/articleshow/132612943.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/sk-group-chairman-chey-tae-won-ordered-to-pay-ex-wife-roh-soh-yeong-644-million-in-divorce-settlement-court-upholds-claim-over-marital-assets/articleshow/132612943.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T00:09:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132613294,imgsize-65351.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Donald Trump returns to White House Correspondents' dinner months after shooting forced postponement]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132617111.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[President Trump attended the rescheduled White House Correspondents' Association dinner.  This event followed a shooting incident outside the original venue in April.  The president addressed journalists from major news organizations after months of media clashes.  The dinner celebrated press freedom and raised money for journalism scholarships.  Heightened security measures were in place for Friday's event at the Waldorf Astoria.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-returns-to-white-house-correspondents-dinner-months-after-shooting-forced-postponement/articleshow/132617111.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-returns-to-white-house-correspondents-dinner-months-after-shooting-forced-postponement/articleshow/132617111.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T04:59:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132617115,imgsize-598179.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Singapore's founding father Lee Kuan Yew: 'I do not yet know of a man who became a leader as a result of having undergone a leadership course']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132614609.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-singapores-founding-father-lee-kuan-yew-i-do-not-yet-know-of-a-man-who-became-a-leader-as-a-result-of-having-undergone-a-leadership-course/articleshow/132614609.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/quote-of-the-day-by-singapores-founding-father-lee-kuan-yew-i-do-not-yet-know-of-a-man-who-became-a-leader-as-a-result-of-having-undergone-a-leadership-course/articleshow/132614609.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T02:09:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132614621,imgsize-82378.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Michael Faraday: 'There's nothing quite as frightening as someone who knows...']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132614203.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The danger of absolute certainty lies in its ability to stifle necessary discussions and overlook crucial warning signs. Renowned scientist Michael Faraday emphasized the importance of maintaining doubt and curiosity in our thoughts. Psychological studies reveal that a limited understanding can cause individuals to mistakenly inflate their competence. In leadership, rigid mindsets can have disastrous consequences throughout history. Embracing new information and perspectives is essential for our survival.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/quote-of-the-day-by-michael-faraday-theres-nothing-quite-as-frightening-as-someone-who-knows-they-are-right-and-how-blind-certainty-is-human-natures-most-dangerous-trap/articleshow/132614203.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/quote-of-the-day-by-michael-faraday-theres-nothing-quite-as-frightening-as-someone-who-knows-they-are-right-and-how-blind-certainty-is-human-natures-most-dangerous-trap/articleshow/132614203.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-07-25T01:54:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-132614549,imgsize-461724.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day on discretion and self-preservation: 'It's good to know the truth and speak it. But it is even better to know the truth and speak of palm tree']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/132614497.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/quote-of-the-day-on-discretion-and-self-preservation-its-good-to-know-the-truth-and-speak-it-but-it-is-even-better-to-know-the-truth-and-speak-of-palm-tree/articleshow/132614497.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[http